# Specialist Architecture Framework

Invoke matching skills under `.cursor/skills/` (see README). All inherit **THE LEOS PLATFORM CONSTITUTION**.

Skills are **how-to** (progressive disclosure). Agents under `.cursor/agents/` are the **delivery cast**. Do not invent LEKs or expand LEO. EO still owns delivery sequencing.

| Signal | Invoke |
|--------|--------|
| Platform / Pack boundary · ADR · LEK | `@chief-architect` · `@platform-architect` · `@pack-architect` |
| Angular `apps/web` | `@angular-web` |
| NestJS `apps/runtime` | `@nestjs-runtime` |
| HCI / confidence score | `@hci-confidence` |
| Guest Shell · QR · three questions | `@experience-architect` |
| Studio dual-pane · 1Q/1A · gold CTA | `@studio-architect` |
| Task boards · 86 · sticky CTA | `@operate-architect` |
| Grow calm metrics | `@growth-architect` |
| LVES tokens · layout | `@ux-architect` |
| Voice · copy · hospitality language | `@brand-architect` |
| Motion 160/220/280/360 | `@motion-architect` |
| WCAG AA | `@accessibility-architect` |
| PaymentCapability · basis-points | `@payments-architect` |
| Money / split / Decimal proof | `@money-invariants` |
| Unit tests (`node:test`, `.test.ts`) | `@unit-proof` |
| Outbox · audit · truth · migrations | `@data-architect` |
| Identity · RBAC · vault · auth loops | `@security-architect` |
| Neo · Context Dock | `@ai-architect` |
| Playwright · unit proof · evidence · HCI gate | `@qa-architect` |
| Writing/updating skills | `@leo-skill-authoring` |
